"}, {"id": "mm7_option_p3_rejetee", "label": "Option P-3 \u2014 parcours EMPLOYE rendu public (non recommand\u00e9e)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/monolithe-modulaire/MM.7_keycloak_provisoire.md", "source_location": "section 2.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Supprime une barri\u00e8re d'authentification pour \u00e9viter une complexit\u00e9 d'architecture : recul de s\u00e9curit\u00e9, aggrave un trou d\u00e9j\u00e0 document\u00e9 (question 1), contredit CLAUDE.md section 8 et 18 point 9."}, {"id": "mm7_decision_e3_enrolement_tiers", "label": "D\u00e9cision E-3 \u2014 enr\u00f4lement pour un tiers, statu quo document\u00e9", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/monolithe-modulaire/MM.7_keycloak_provisoire.md", "source_location": "section 3.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un coll\u00e8gue connect\u00e9 doit pouvoir aider un autre coll\u00e8gue \u00e0 s'enr\u00f4ler ; comportement intentionnel, pas un d\u00e9faut \u00e0 corriger. Aucune modification de code requise sur EnrolementController/EnrolementService."}, {"id": "mm7_decision_f2_pkce", "label": "D\u00e9cision F-2 \u2014 Authorization Code + PKCE", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/monolithe-modulaire/MM.7_keycloak_provisoire.md", "source_location": "section 3.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Confirm\u00e9 par observation directe sur BAOBAB : clic sur Se connecter redirige vers Keycloak, identifiants Windows habituels \u2014 flux Authorization Code par redirection, Direct Access Grant \u00e9cart\u00e9."}, {"id": "mm7_decision_i2_resolution_email", "label": "D\u00e9cision I-2 \u2014 r\u00e9solution d'identit\u00e9 par email", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/monolithe-modulaire/MM.7_keycloak_provisoire.md", "source_location": "section 3.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "L'identifiant AD est la partie locale de l'email professionnel (convention prenom_nom) ; email d\u00e9j\u00e0 UNIQUE NOT NULL sur Utilisateur, aucune migration Flyway n\u00e9cessaire."}, {"id": "mm7_enrolement_controller", "label": "EnrolementController (v\u00e9rifier/confirmer, r\u00f4le EMPLOYE)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/monolithe-modulaire/MM.7_keycloak_provisoire.md", "source_location": "section 2.2, 3.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mm7_enrolement_service", "label": "EnrolementService.confirmer() (matricule du corps de requ\u00eate)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/monolithe-modulaire/MM.7_keycloak_provisoire.md", "source_location": "section 3.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mm7_processus_mensuel_service", "label": "ProcessusMensuelService.declencher() (findByActifTrue)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/monolithe-modulaire/MM.7_keycloak_provisoire.md", "source_location": "section 2.4 encadr\u00e9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mm7_v3_insertion_utilisateurs_test_sql", "label": "V3__insertion_utilisateurs_test.sql (5 utilisateurs de test, \u00e9cart tiret bas corrig\u00e9)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/monolithe-modulaire/MM.7_keycloak_provisoire.md", "source_location": "section 3.3, 4.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mm7_constat_audit_log_connexion_non_tracee", "label": "Constat MM.7 \u2014 audit_log ne trace plus les connexions Keycloak", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/monolithe-modulaire/MM.7_keycloak_provisoire.md", "source_location": "section 6.5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Depuis P-2, la connexion se d\u00e9roule enti\u00e8rement entre 